    translit: "Svāyattamekāntaguṇaṃ vidhātrā vinirmitaṃ chādanamajñatāyāḥ |\nViśeṣataḥ sarvavidāṃ samāje vibhūṣaṇaṃ maunampaṇḍitānām ||",
