    translit: "Tāṃ cintayāmi satataṃ mayi tatprasannāṃ\nPremapravāhaparipūrṇamanobhirāmām |\nItthaṃ vicintayati māṃ smaravāhinībhiḥ\nSantāpayatyasamabāṇaviṣairaṇaṅgaḥ ||",
