    meaningEn: "The necklace crushes the slender-waisted one — yet she wears ornaments with ease. Between the firm twin globes of her breast, the glance is unsteady, and the eyes are bewildered. On these, like golden and blue lotus petals, all virtues that delight the eye dance — and there wealth dances.",
