    translit: "Manasi vacasi vāci prītirutpadyate yadā\nTadiha khalu sukhaṃ syād durlabhaṃ kiṃ tataḥ param |\nAdharamadhu pibantyaḥ sambhrame ṇeva bhṛṅgyaḥ\nPriyatama kathayanti svāminaṃ kāścinte ||",
