    translit: "Phalamalghu vicitram puṣpamalpapramāṇaṃ\nNayanasubhagametat pallavairnopameyam |\nKimu bahutarasāraṃ saumyasaṃsparśamekaṃ\nYadiha malayagandhah sāgarottīrṇavātaḥ ||",
