    meaningEn: "Somewhere, a man sits — the earth imprinted with his beloved's footsteps, the trees bowing under their burden; suffering the long path of longing, he sees her even in dreams. Sitting somewhere and thinking only of wandering to be near her, his cheek-breezes of sighing cool the surrounding air.",
