    translit: "Kṣaṇamekamapi jīvitaṃ tava paśyan\nMukhpaadmaṃ madhurasmitaikadeśam |\nSaphalaṃ syāditi manyate jano'yaṃ\nManasā kiṃ na karotyabaddhabhāvaḥ ||",
