    translit: "Cintāṃ parityajya sukhī bhava tvaṃ\nNa hi cintayā vardhate yadabhīṣṭam |\nBhavatyabhūtaṃ nahi cintayā tat\nkiṃ cintayā jīvitameva hanti ||",
