    translit: "Paśyāmi devān vividhān mahīśān\nSomaṃ raviṃ pāvakamambhurāśim |\nSarvatra māṃ paśyati cāntarātmā\nko vā paraṃ paśyati ko nirīkṣyaḥ ||",
