    translit: "Jātīyasaṃyogavaśena jīvāḥ\nsaṃyānti yoniṃ punareva sarve |\nAntaḥ kaṣāyaṃ pariśodhya bhānoḥ\nkiranā iva svacchatayā viśanti ||",
