    translit: "He Śambho Śiva Śaṅkara trinayana trailokyanātha prabho\nBhūteśākhilabhūtibhūṣaṇa hara vyomordhvakeśa prabho |\nSarvajña tvamasīti vedmi satataṃ tatkiṃ na jānāsi māṃ\ntvatpāde hṛdayaṃ mamāsti satataṃ kiṃ tan na bodhasyapi ||",
