    translit: "Kadācillīlayā bhartuḥ pādanyāsānukāriṇī |\nSvayameva sthitā bālā priyā priyatamasya sā ||",
    meaningEn: "Sometimes playfully imitating the footsteps of her husband's gait, standing by herself — she is the beloved of the most beloved.",
